{"type":"message","message":{"id":"gen-1775393068-Wg8heIz3AHRl80ChXBfx","role":"assistant","created":1775393071,"content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"It seems like the chart itself isn't in the text file. Let me look for the table that should have the data. Let me search more broadly for what might be in the chart on page 21. The chart seems to be about \"Gross Federal Obligations\" and \"gross Federal obligations incurred outside the Federal Government\". Let me look at the FO-2 table mentioned in the contents.\n","signature":""},{"type":"toolRequest","id":"call_3db7a245acf445de8a498f09","toolCall":{"status":"success","value":{"name":"shell","arguments":{"command":"grep -n \"FO-2\" /app/resources/treasury_bulletin_1988_09.txt"}}},"_meta":{"goose_extension":"developer"}}],"metadata":{"userVisible":true,"agentVisible":true}}}
{"type":"message","message":{"id":"msg_08da2deb-eb98-4b0f-a502-a9c6d91a3bfb","role":"user","created":1775393071,"content":[{"type":"toolResponse","id":"call_3db7a245acf445de8a498f09","toolResult":{"status":"success","value":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"78:| FFO-2.--On-budget and off-budget receipts by source | 13.0 |\n83:| FO-2.--Gross obligations incurred outside the Federal Government by department or agency | 19.0 |\n362:The first three Federal fiscal operations (FFO) tables are published quarterly and cover 5 years of data, estimates for 2 years, detail for 13 months, and fiscal year-to-date data. The tables are designed to provide a summary of data relating to Federal fiscal operations reported by Federal entities and disbursing officers, and daily reports from the Federal Reserve banks. These reports detail accounting transactions affecting receipts and outlays of the Federal Government and off-budget Federal entities, and their related effect on the assets and liabilities of the U.S. Government. Data used in the preparation of tables FFO-1, FFO-2, and FFO-3 is derived from the Monthly Treasury Statement of Receipts and Outlays of the United States Government.\n578:Table FFO-2.--On-budget and Off-budget Receipts by Source\n642:Table FFO-2.--On-budget and Off-budget Receipts by Source--Continued\n813:Federal agencies often do business with one another; in doing so, the \"buying\" agency records obligations, and the \"performing agency records reimbursements. In table FO-1, obligations incurred within the Government are distinguished from those incurred outside the Government. Table FO-2 shows only those incurred outside.\n860:Table FO-2.--Gross Obligations Incurred Outside the Federal Government by Department or Agency, as of Mar. 31, 1988\n917:Table FO-2.--Gross Obligations Incurred Outside the Federal Government by Department or Agency, as of Mar. 31, 1988--Continued","annotations":{"priority":0.0}}],"structuredContent":{"stdout":"78:| FFO-2.--On-budget and off-budget receipts by source | 13.0 |\n83:| FO-2.--Gross obligations incurred outside the Federal Government by department or agency | 19.0 |\n362:The first three Federal fiscal operations (FFO) tables are published quarterly and cover 5 years of data, estimates for 2 years, detail for 13 months, and fiscal year-to-date data. The tables are designed to provide a summary of data relating to Federal fiscal operations reported by Federal entities and disbursing officers, and daily reports from the Federal Reserve banks. These reports detail accounting transactions affecting receipts and outlays of the Federal Government and off-budget Federal entities, and their related effect on the assets and liabilities of the U.S. Government. Data used in the preparation of tables FFO-1, FFO-2, and FFO-3 is derived from the Monthly Treasury Statement of Receipts and Outlays of the United States Government.\n578:Table FFO-2.--On-budget and Off-budget Receipts by Source\n642:Table FFO-2.--On-budget and Off-budget Receipts by Source--Continued\n813:Federal agencies often do business with one another; in doing so, the \"buying\" agency records obligations, and the \"performing agency records reimbursements. In table FO-1, obligations incurred within the Government are distinguished from those incurred outside the Government. Table FO-2 shows only those incurred outside.\n860:Table FO-2.--Gross Obligations Incurred Outside the Federal Government by Department or Agency, as of Mar. 31, 1988\n917:Table FO-2.--Gross Obligations Incurred Outside the Federal Government by Department or Agency, as of Mar. 31, 1988--Continued","stderr":"","exit_code":0},"isError":false}}}],"metadata":{"userVisible":true,"agentVisible":true}}}
