d:\n\n\nI'll break down each component to confirm my calculation. I add up personnel compensation, benefits, and various service categories to get a total of 156,412. Then I subtract this from the total obligations to determine the non-service-related amount, which comes to 458,556. This represents about 74.57% of the total obligations when rounded to 75%.\n","signature":""},{"type":"toolRequest","id":"call_24fb10da250a4cc190662913","toolCall":{"status":"success","value":{"name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/app/answer.txt","content":"75"}}},"_meta":{"goose_extension":"developer"}}],"metadata":{"userVisible":true,"agentVisible":true}}}
